WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A small promise: twelve minutes.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A bigger claim: the effects of an hour.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Researchers have studied sound and brainwaves.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Their results are mixed.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
These findings do not test this exact product.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try a free routine first. Decide with evidence.
